      "description": "Temporary Adjunct Faculty, School Psychology AY26-27 Location Governors State University, IL Job Type Faculty Job Number ADJ202600032 Division Psychology and Counseling Department Psychology & Counseling Opening Date 10/09/2026 FLSA Exempt Bargaining Unit 0 Description Benefits Questions Description Adjuncts are hired on a course basis each term. Salary Range for Adjuncts teaching in this academic area is $1,500.00 - $3,300.00 per course Governors State University’s College of Education seeks to create an available pool of Adjunct Faculty candidates to teach graduate courses in School Psychology in the Division of Psychology & Counseling. Interested individuals are invited to complete a faculty profile, attach a curriculum vitae, and transcripts for consideration. At Governors State University, adjunct faculty are hired as temporary faculty with teaching responsibilities for a specific course in a semester or summer session. Adjuncts are not a part of the faculty bargaining unit and are not included in membership of the Faculty Senate. Required and Preferred Qualifications Minimum Qualifications Master’s Degree in School Psychology or related field. Preferred Qualifications Doctorate or Specialist Degree in School Psychology. Supplemental Information Please attach the following documents to your application: Cover Letter CV or Resume Transcript This position is not eligible for benefits. 01 What is the highest level of education attained? GED HS eequivalent High School Diploma Associate's Degree Bachelor's Degree Master's Degree Doctorate Degree ABD 02 Do you have a Master's degree in Psychology, Marriage & Family Therapy, or Counseling? Yes No 03 What academic discipline did you earn your degree(s) in? 04 Do you have experience teaching at the college/university level? Yes No 05 Please select your availability to teach. Days only Evenings only Weekends only Days and Evenings only Days, Evenings and Weekends Evenings and Weekends only Online only 06 Experience teaching in online/hybrid delivery? Yes No Required Question Employer Governors State University (IL) Address 1 University Pkwy University Park, Illinois, 60484 Phone 708-534-5000 Website https://www.govst.edu/ Apply"
